# @kisaesdevlab/* is published to GitHub Packages, which needs a token even for reads.
# The token is NEVER written here: export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (a PAT with read:packages, or
# `gh auth token`) and put the _authToken line in your user-level ~/.npmrc. See docs/sso.md.
@kisaesdevlab:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
